   "date": "2022-05-12",
   "text": "Price Gouging Prevention Act of 2022 \n This bill generally makes it unlawful to sell or offer for sale a good or service at an unconscionably excessive price during an exceptional market shock.\n The bill also provides additional funding to the Federal Trade Commission."
